1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,110
This robot's skin

2
00:00:01,110 --> 00:00:02,140
is alive.

3
00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:02,790
They grew it from

4
00:00:02,790 --> 00:00:03,940
human cells…

5
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:04,550
then attached it

6
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:05,590
to a mechanical face

7
00:00:05,590 --> 00:00:07,020
and made it smile.

8
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:08,350
Tiny anchors hold the skin

9
00:00:08,350 --> 00:00:09,880
while motors pull underneath.

10
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:11,730
But an earlier experiment

11
00:00:11,730 --> 00:00:12,850
gets stranger.

12
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:14,090
They cut living skin

13
00:00:14,090 --> 00:00:15,460
on a robotic finger…

14
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:16,800
added a collagen patch…

15
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:17,730
and gave the tissue

16
00:00:17,730 --> 00:00:19,530
seven days to repair.

17
00:00:19,530 --> 00:00:20,890
Cells grew into the patch,

18
00:00:20,890 --> 00:00:22,500
helping close the damage.

19
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:24,700
The machine isn’t alive.

20
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:25,130
But the skin

21
00:00:25,130 --> 00:00:26,830
it’s wearing is.

